; error: 8:11: 'inc' is a '[bind @r]' lambda, which changes what it keeps, so it is held in a 'flex' variable: 'flex inc = …'
; A '[bind @r]' lambda changes what it keeps, so it is never copied, as a
; '[flex @r]' one is: a 'flex' variable holds it.

task main()
    region r
    flex xs = [1, ...] at r
    fixed inc = [bind @r](n: int) -> nothing
        xs[0] = xs[0] + n
    fi
    inc(2)
fi
